        {
            "type": "html",
            "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-3\">What We <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Create</span>\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mx-auto mb-5\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\">From a single room to a full turnkey build, The\n                    Omega Group designs and delivers interiors across residential and commercial categories — always\n                    led by one design team, one point of contact, and one standard of craftsmanship.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row g-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                src=\"/img/service-1.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Luxury living room interior with custom furnishings by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                            <h4>Luxury Home Interiors</h4>\n                            <p>Full-home interiors tailored to your lifestyle, from layout and lighting to furniture\n                                and finishes.</p>\n                            <a href=\"/service.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Read More <i\n                                    class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                src=\"/img/service-2.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Villa and apartment living room interior styled by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                            <h4>Villa &amp; Apartment Interiors</h4>\n                            <p>Considered interiors for villas and apartments that balance comfort, style, and\n                                everyday practicality.</p>\n                            <a href=\"/service.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Read More <i\n                                    class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                src=\"/img/service-3.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Custom cabinetry and styled reading corner by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                            <h4>Bespoke Furniture</h4>\n                            <p>Custom-made furniture and cabinetry designed to fit your space, proportions, and\n                                material palette exactly.</p>\n                            <a href=\"/service.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Read More <i\n                                    class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.4s\">\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                src=\"/img/service-4.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Modern living space with clean lines suited to office and commercial interiors by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                            <h4>Office &amp; Commercial</h4>\n                            <p>Workspaces and commercial interiors designed for brand identity, comfort, and everyday\n                                function.</p>\n                            <a href=\"/service.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Read More <i\n                                    class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center mt-5\">\n                <a href=\"/service.html\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary px-4 py-2\">View All Services</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "html",
            "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"row g-5\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid\"\n                                src=\"/img/about-1.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Contemporary open-plan kitchen with pendant lighting designed by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                            <img class=\"img-fluid h-75\"\n                                src=\"/img/about-2.webp\"\n                                alt=\"Warm, timber-accented living space crafted by The Omega Group\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                            <div class=\"h-25 d-flex align-items-center text-center bg-primary px-4 about-badge\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-white lh-base mb-0 about-badge-title\">10+ Years of Design Excellence</h4>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\"><span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">About</span> The Omega\n                        Group</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">The Omega Group is a premium interior design and turnkey execution studio,\n                        crafting refined homes and commercial spaces for clients who value thoughtful design as much\n                        as flawless delivery. For over 10 years, we have partnered with luxury homeowners, villa and\n                        apartment owners, architects, and businesses to turn ambitious ideas into interiors that feel\n                        personal, effortless, and enduring.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-5\">Every project begins with a conversation, not a template. Our design team studies\n                        how you live and work, then carries that understanding through concept, material selection,\n                        and on-site execution — managing every stage under one accountable roof, so you never have to\n                        coordinate multiple vendors.</p>\n                    <div class=\"row g-3\">\n                        <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-3\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Bespoke Design Approach</h6>\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Certified Design\n                                Professionals</h6>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-3\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Single-Point Turnkey\n                                Execution</h6>\n                            <h6 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"fa fa-check text-primary me-2\"></i>Premium Material Sourcing\n                            </h6>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center mt-5\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-primary px-4 me-2\" href=\"/about.html\">Explore More</a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2 me-2\"\n                            href=\"https://www.facebook.com/theomegainteriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"The Omega Group on Facebook\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2 me-2\"\n                            href=\"https://www.instagram.com/theomegainteriors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"The Omega Group on Instagram\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a>\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-square border-2\"\n                            href=\"https://wa.me/919811001900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n                            aria-label=\"Chat with The Omega Group on WhatsApp\"><i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "html",
            "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">Our <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Difference</span></h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row g-4 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-pencil-ruler fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Customized Design</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">No two projects share a template. Every layout, palette, and finish is\n                            developed around how you actually live or work.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-gem fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Premium Materials</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">We source finishes, fittings, and furnishings from trusted premium suppliers,\n                            so every surface performs as beautifully as it looks.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-tasks fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>End-to-End Execution</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Design, procurement, and site execution are managed by one team, so your\n                            project moves forward without gaps or handovers.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-user-tie fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Expert Designers</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Our design consultants bring years of residential and commercial experience to\n                            every consultation and site visit.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-clipboard-check fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Transparent Process</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Clear timelines, itemised costing, and regular updates keep you informed at\n                            every stage, with no hidden surprises.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-calendar-check fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>On-Time Delivery</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Disciplined project planning and dedicated site supervision help us deliver\n                            every space on schedule.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "faq",
            "id": "faq-home",
            "items": [
                {
                    "question": "What does The Omega Group do?",
                    "answer": "The Omega Group is a luxury interior design and turnkey execution studio based in Gurgaon. We design and deliver residential and commercial interiors — homes, villas, apartments, modular kitchens, bespoke furniture, and office spaces — managing design, procurement, and site execution as one team."
                },
                {
                    "question": "Which areas do you serve?",
                    "answerHtml": "We're headquartered on Dwarka Expressway and serve clients across Gurgaon, including DLF, Sushant Lok, Sohna Road, New Gurgaon, and Manesar. See our <a href=\"/interior-designers-gurgaon/\">Gurgaon service area page</a> for details."
                },
                {
                    "question": "How much does interior design cost?",
                    "answer": "Full-home turnkey interior design starts at ₹15 Lakhs+, scaling with home size, material grade, and customization. Every quote is itemised before work begins."
                },
                {
                    "question": "Do you handle both design and execution?",
                    "answer": "Yes — every project is turnkey. Our own team handles design, material procurement, and on-site execution, so you have a single point of contact rather than coordinating a designer and a separate contractor."
                },
                {
                    "question": "How long does a project take?",
                    "answer": "Most full-home turnkey projects take 8–16 weeks from design sign-off to handover, depending on size and the level of customization."
                },
                {
                    "question": "How do I book a consultation?",
                    "answerHtml": "Visit our <a href=\"/contact.html\">Contact page</a> to book a complimentary design consultation, or call us directly at +91 981 1001 900."
                }
            ],
            "headingHtml": "Frequently Asked <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Questions</span>"
        },
        {
            "type": "html",
            "html": "<div class=\"container-xxl py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">Client <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Love</span></h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                    <div class=\"owl-carousel testimonial-carousel wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>The Omega Group listened to how our family actually lives before drawing a single\n                                    layout. The result feels curated but never staged, and the execution was handled\n                                    without a single missed deadline.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Rohan Mehta, Villa Owner</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>We never had to manage a single vendor ourselves. From design to the final coat of\n                                    paint, The Omega Group's team took full ownership, and the finish quality exceeded\n                                    what we expected.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Ananya Iyer, Apartment Owner</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>The design team understood our brand identity and translated it into a workspace\n                                    our clients and employees both comment on. Communication throughout the project\n                                    was clear and consistent.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Karan Shah, Business Owner</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
        },
